      "writtenOn": "2017-10-11T15:58:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Honestly this is a terrible hack, I don\u0027t the build system to randomly erase my directory.\n\nIMO we should do it as other make-based build systems are doing it, just add a dependency to the file where you are saving your current variables to the build rules.",
